<title>USA: Forrest Cty, Miss., won by Duncan Williams.</title>
<headline>Forrest Cty, Miss., won by Duncan Williams.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Duncan Williams said it won $8 million of Forrest County, Miss., general obligation bonds, Series 1996, with a net interest cost of 5.1488 percent.</p>
